; claude: HyperCard's language (see
; docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_gui_teaching.md): HyperTalk's words
; parsed and run against a world given as functions, so that it knows
; nothing of cards or screens (Hypertalk). Used by TinyHyperCard and
; TinyMyst, each with cards of its own.
; A private library, installed as part of elm_playground: pure OCaml.
(library
 (name hypertalk)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
)
